EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for the email about changing your major.

You can request a change of major through My ASU at https://my.asu.edu/ by clicking “Change My Major” under your application status. Please remember that some majors have additional requirements, which can be viewed through degree search at http://asu.edu/programs.

Let me know if there is anything else I can assist with.

Thank you,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}


If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
